  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "CHILLAXIN ON 30A | Your Home Away from Home<br><br>ROSEMARY MINUTES AWAY! COMMUNITY POOL! Indulge in the charm of our new beach house! This modern retreat offers a cozy and stylish escape just moments from the shore. It's an ideal choice for your coastal getaway with thoughtfully designed interiors, nearby attractions, and a relaxing atmosphere. Come make beautiful beach memories with us! Lake nearby, for fun fishing and kayaking as well! Sleeps 15<br><br>BACHELORETTE/BACHELOR & FAMILY PARTIES ARE WELCOME!<br>The space<br>Welcome to Chillaxin on 30A, a captivating retreat located in the best area of the 30A. This elegantly decorated haven is a chic getaway that captures the true spirit of the neighborhood. With its charming interiors and convenient location, it offers a remarkable stay that seamlessly blends comfort and convenience.<br><br>Step inside and see the gorgeous staircase that connects all three levels of this beach house. The first floor boasts a bunk bed with a full-size bunk on the bottom with a twin on top, but don’t forget the twin trundle for extra fun! Off to the left you will see a stately queen room with standing mirror and lots of closet space. There is a private bathroom with a shower for this floor.<br><br>The second floor features a private suite with sleeping space in a California king room, making it ideal for families and groups. Off this room is another private bathroom with a shower and bathtub in one.<br><br>The spacious living room with a huge flatscreen TV also doubles as TWO queen pull-out couch beds.<br><br>The third floor opens up into a giant primary master with another California king bed and a huge bathroom with a spacious shower and high-end finishes. There is also a to-die-for walk-in closet where we store an ADDITIONAL roll-out twin bed for all of your best friends and family!<br><br>As you venture out, you'll discover that the location is the gateway to both tranquility and exploration. The Gulf of Mexico is within a short 15-minute walk, allowing you to relish the powdery sands and crystal waters that define this coastal paradise. The neighborhood pool and Lake are just a quick hop around the corner, less than a 3-minute walk.<br><br>This home is tailored to provide relaxation and memorable moments, making it the perfect setting for your getaway. Your stay includes beach gear, a fully equipped kitchen, an outdoor grill, a coffee maker, a washer/dryer, WiFi, Smart TVs, Netflix, linens/towels & more.<br><br>Drive 5 minutes to scenic 30A and enjoy Rosemary Beach, Alys, Seacrest & more. Walk to the community pool and only a 15-minute walk to public beach access. (Free parking at the beach)<br><br>- Driveway Parking for 4 vehicles. (2 in garage)<br>- Access to Community Amenities that include a resort-style pool and gathering rooms<br>- TWO full Covered back porch<br>- Full open kitchen with high-end appliances and ample supply of kitchenware for your cooking needs<br>- Spacious living room with Smart TV<br>- Smart TVs in all bedrooms<br>- Outdoor shower next to back entrance of home<br>- Gas grill with grill utensils<br>- 1st-floor laundry closet with washer and dryer<br>- Early check-in and Late check-out available with prior request<br>- Events such as Bachelor and Bachelorette parties, children’s birthdays, and family gatherings are welcome with prior approval<br><br>Sleeps 15:<br>Bunk bed: Twin Trundle (1), Full (1), Twin Top Bunk (1)<br>Downstairs Queen: (2)<br>Second Floor California-King: (2)<br>Third Floor California King: (2)<br>Third Floor Loft Twin: (1)<br>One Rollout-Twin bed in Master Closet: (1)<br>Living room: Pullout Sofa-bed Queen (2), Pullout Sofa-bed Queen (2)<br>Guest access<br>All of the space is available for the guests!!<br>During your stay, you'll have access to the entire property, as well as the community pool. The Gulf's powdery sands await, a short walk away.<br>Other things to note<br>YouTube search #Chillaxinon30A to view a virtual walkthrough.<br><br>Distance to Airports<br><br>Northwest Florida Beaches International Airport (ECP)<br>Approximately 20 miles (30 to 40-minute drive)<br><br>Destin-Fort Walton Beach Airport (VPS):<br>Approximately 50 miles (1 hour to 1 hour and 15-minute drive)",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
